<title>ITALY: Olivetti next try to restart trade 1456GMT.</title>
<headline>Olivetti next try to restart trade 1456GMT.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Another effort to restart trade in Olivetti shares will be made at 1456 GMT just ahead of the 1500 GMT stock exchange close, a Bourse Council spokesman said.</p>
<p>The stock was earlier suspended for the second time today after it resumed trading down 9.93 percent at 516 lire and immediately moved to touch a new record low of 515 lire.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
